<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh tenge rises to 75.0000 to dlr.</title>
<headline>Kazakh tenge rises to 75.0000 to dlr.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tenge closed at 75.0000 per dollar on the Kazakhstan Currency Exchange on Wednesday after 75.3500 on Tuesday.</p>
<p> TENGE PER DOLLAR	     April 9		 April 8</p>
<p> High			     75.3398		 75.3000</p>
<p> Low				74.9999		 75.3540</p>
<p> Open			     75.3398		 75.3000</p>
<p> Close			    75.0000		 75.3500</p>
<p> Volume ($ million)	    6.400		   4.150</p>
<p> TENGE PER MARK		 April 9		 April 8</p>
<p> Hihg			     44.3000		 44.8000</p>
<p> Low				43.6500		 43.8000</p>
<p> Open			     43.6500		 43.8000</p>
<p> Close			    44.3000		 44.8000</p>
<p> Volume ($ million)	    0.040		   0.025</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, + 7 3272 509410</p>
